	<RM_TanksOff>Unpowered: {0} — nothing prints from them</RM_TanksOff>
	<RM_TanksExplain>Matter — what printing uses: mass (kg) and value (silver), split between tanks by capacity.\nComputer — keeps patterns and print queues, runs matter splitters and replicators.\nMatter splitter — splits items and corpses into matter and always records patterns.\nReplicator — prints items and mechanoids from matter.\nTank — stores matter, and once the tanks are full, mass stops accumulating.\nValue — every item has its own, as with traders, and it can be stored without limit.\nMass — every item has its own, it is stored as far as the tanks hold.\nPrinting — takes the item's mass and value from the tanks.</RM_TanksExplain>
	<RM_SpeedExplain>Bill print speed grows with Crafting skill and mech gestation processors.</RM_SpeedExplain>
